              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "Extract the facts from this evidence item."
            },
            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"63af76660ee549661f3c3ae1a9b02c3e71f519e2502af60ccfb2ad3bb4f8df2c\" kind=\"text\" label=\"delivery evidence\">\nKivuli Sandal Studio\nHandover date: 12 March 2025\nBuyer: Nara Vale\nCarrier: DHL Express\nTracking: J7K4M2N8P6Q3\n\nThe parcel was sealed and handed to the courier today. The packing sheet records: two pairs of brown leather sandals in EU size 40; no cotton drawstring storage bags; two spare leather ankle straps. The remaining two straps were not packed.\n\nThe footbeds were covered by protective tissue before the packing check. The handover note does not record whether initials were stamped beneath the tissue. The buyer was sent the tracking details after handover and asked to check the contents on arrival.\n</evidence>"
            }
          ]
        }
